hint: '.' (line 3) is unmodeled: it is the first wall -- an oracle vouching its convergence would elide it when converged; 1 more unmodeled wall -- dorc why
dorc: run `dorc why` for the per-site cause-chains, or `dorc why book.sh:N` to query a source line
